The intelligence ramp from GPT-5.2 to 5.3 to 5.4 to 5.5 has been the most rapid I've experienced. For me, 5.5 is an amazing prototyper, coder, and research assistant. The packaging inside of Codex is next level.

Such an exciting time. Intelligence begets intelligence in all sorts of ways, both expected and unexpected. I'm excited and nervous to watch 2026 play out.

@OpenAI: "Introducing GPT-5.5. A new class of intelligence for real work and powering agents, built to understand complex goals, use tools, check its work, and carry more tasks through to completion. It marks a new way of getting computer work done. Now available in ChatGPT and Codex."
